        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Edge of Extinction is a real-time strategy game where positioning, formations, and decision-making define victory. Set across hostile plateaus suspended in space and time, the game challenges players to command their forces under constant pressure in battles where no terrain remains unchanged.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A War Engineered by the Galactic Federation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Galactic Federation is a coalition of highly advanced alien species that manipulates emerging civilizations for its own purposes. Entire species are abducted and transported to remote battlegrounds—fractured worlds where survival is earned through combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These forced conflicts are not wars of choice. They are trials. Only the strongest factions endure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five Distinct Factions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can command one of five unique factions, each with its own visual identity, units, and strategic approach:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t•\tHumans – adaptable and resource-efficient</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t•\tVenusians – specialized and environment-focused</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t•\tArcturians – disciplined and technologically advanced</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t•\tThe Greys – unconventional tactics and alien warfare</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t•\tReptilians – aggressive and force-driven</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each faction encourages a different playstyle, rewarding mastery and experimentation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical RTS Combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Edge of Extinction emphasizes direct control over armies. Units can be organized into formations, repositioned on the battlefield, and issued precise commands in real time. Terrain deformation occurs dynamically during combat, altering sightlines and movement paths without acting as a weapon—forcing players to continuously adapt their strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory depends on:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t•\tSmart unit positioning</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t•\tEffective formation usage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t•\tResource management and timing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t•\tReading the battlefield as it evolves</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Modes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t•\tCampaign Mode – A focused three-mission campaign that introduces mechanics and narrative through in-game dialogue and structured objectives</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t•\tCustom Matches – Set up your own battles and experiment with different factions and strategies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t•\tSurvival Mode – Endure escalating enemy waves, currently progressing to round 11, with further expansion planned</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built to Evolve</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed in Unity with a clean, readable low-poly art style, Edge of Extinction is designed as a growing RTS experience. Ongoing updates focus on refining gameplay systems, expanding modes, and improving presentation while staying true to classic real-time strategy fundamentals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battlefield is unstable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The conflict is unavoidable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt—or face extinction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add Edge of Extinction to your wishlist and prepare to lead your faction into forced war.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Edge of Extinction is a real-time strategy game where positioning, formations, and decision-making define victory. Set across hostile plateaus suspended in space and time, the game challenges players to command their forces under constant pressure in battles where no terrain remains unchanged.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A War Engineered by the Galactic Federation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Galactic Federation is a coalition of highly advanced alien species that manipulates emerging civilizations for its own purposes. Entire species are abducted and transported to remote battlegrounds—fractured worlds where survival is earned through combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These forced conflicts are not wars of choice. They are trials. Only the strongest factions endure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five Distinct Factions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can command one of five unique factions, each with its own visual identity, units, and strategic approach:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t•\tHumans – adaptable and resource-efficient</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t•\tVenusians – specialized and environment-focused</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t•\tArcturians – disciplined and technologically advanced</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t•\tThe Greys – unconventional tactics and alien warfare</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t•\tReptilians – aggressive and force-driven</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each faction encourages a different playstyle, rewarding mastery and experimentation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical RTS Combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Edge of Extinction emphasizes direct control over armies. Units can be organized into formations, repositioned on the battlefield, and issued precise commands in real time. Terrain deformation occurs dynamically during combat, altering sightlines and movement paths without acting as a weapon—forcing players to continuously adapt their strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory depends on:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t•\tSmart unit positioning</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t•\tEffective formation usage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t•\tResource management and timing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t•\tReading the battlefield as it evolves</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Modes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t•\tCampaign Mode – A focused three-mission campaign that introduces mechanics and narrative through in-game dialogue and structured objectives</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t•\tCustom Matches – Set up your own battles and experiment with different factions and strategies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t•\tSurvival Mode – Endure escalating enemy waves, currently progressing to round 11, with further expansion planned</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built to Evolve</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed in Unity with a clean, readable low-poly art style, Edge of Extinction is designed as a growing RTS experience. Ongoing updates focus on refining gameplay systems, expanding modes, and improving presentation while staying true to classic real-time strategy fundamentals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battlefield is unstable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The conflict is unavoidable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt—or face extinction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add Edge of Extinction to your wishlist and prepare to lead your faction into forced war.</p>",
